# Core design only; source identities and proof receipts remain in Org.
title: WEAVER / CURRENT SOURCE JOIN / FINAL ADMISSION CAS {
  class: title
  near: top-center
}
protocols: GO / ORIGINAL JOIN RECOVERY {
  top: 0
  left: 0
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f7faf9"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  mcp: Resolve the original join result\nLost response grants no new permit\nRetain original pending constraints {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: cloud
  }
  a2a: Read current floor and source context\nSame floor can hide account changes\nOld validation grants no authority {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: cloud
  }
  acp: Cloud native worker recovery\nDiscard volatile validation tickets\nRecover original source custody {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: cloud
  }
  goBrand: "" {
    shape: image
    icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/go.svg
    top: 247
    left: 24
    width: 42
    height: 22
  }
  kubernetesBrand: "" {
    shape: image
    icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/kubernetes.svg
    top: 247
    left: 82
    width: 28
    height: 28
  }
}
registry: SCHEME / EXACT JOIN CONTRACT {
  top: 0
  left: 440
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f8fafb"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  origin: Exact original attempt binding\nAccount image and committed journal\nOriginal claim / profile / reservation {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: semantic
  }
  alias: Cedar Code as Policy\nCurrent source / Policy / history\nEvery dependency change invalidates {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: policy
  }
  query: Unknown source retains its hold\nOriginal tail cannot be readmitted\nControl commit applies no money {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
}
recovery: RUST / SOURCE OWNER JOIN {
  top: 0
  left: 880
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f7faf9"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  projection: Capture current source revision\nBind account / floor / worker facts\nTicket records an observation only {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: semantic
  }
  join: Recoverable source-owner custody\nRetain exact attempt and body pins\nSerialize mutations with actual CAS {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
  fence: Revalidate at determining publication\nExact ticket and current source allow\nActual floor and account gates {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: policy
  }
}
broker: RUST / FINAL GATE AND RECOVERY {
  top: 0
  left: 1320
  width: 350
  height: 690
  label.near: top-center
  style.font-size: 17
  style.fill: "#f8fafb"
  style.stroke: "#9bb6ad"
  cas: Commit the exact original result\nCurrent source / account / floor join\nNo unfenced downstream continuation {
    top: 90
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: runtime
  }
  alias: Revalidate changed original attempts\nNo cached allow across source ABA\nCurrent owner at actual effect {
    top: 295
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: policy
  }
  hold: Recover unresolved original custody\nPending tail and unknown hold remain\nFinal sending keeps its own gates {
    top: 500
    left: 20
    width: 310
    height: 120
    label.near: center-center
    class: semantic
  }
  rustBrand: "" {
    shape: image
    icon: ../../architecture/diagrams/assets/rust.svg
    top: 40
    left: 156
    width: 34
    height: 34
  }
}
quint: QUINT\nSame floor and changed account / source ABA\nLost commit / changed attempt / stale worker {
  top: 810
  left: 220
  width: 610
  height: 100
  class: policy
}
lean: LEAN\nActual floor / handoff / account composition\nExact join invalidation / original unknown holds {
  top: 810
  left: 960
  width: 610
  height: 100
  class: semantic
}
protocols.mcp -> registry.origin
protocols.a2a -> registry.alias
protocols.acp -> registry.query
registry.origin -> recovery.projection
registry.alias -> recovery.join
registry.query -> recovery.fence { style.stroke-dash: 4 }
recovery.projection -> recovery.join
recovery.join -> recovery.fence
recovery.fence -> broker.cas
broker.cas -> broker.alias
broker.alias -> broker.hold
broker.hold -> broker.cas: Refresh current join { style.stroke-dash: 4 }

